{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;</strong><i>Uh Oh&quot;</i> is a short horror experience about exploring an entertainment experimentation facility and finding the limits of the content generation cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Uh Oh</i>, you'll evade a familiar foe and discover the twisted truth behind his creation by playing by 'their' rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046950/extras/a15c19d37eef5c107e7cac090567884b.poster.avif?t=1760385891\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046950/extras/a15c19d37eef5c107e7cac090567884b.webm?t=1760385891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046950/extras/a15c19d37eef5c107e7cac090567884b.mp4?t=1760385891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off with the misbegotten child of television classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short experience intended to last around an hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive found footage format, experience the game through a retro VHS camcorder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spatialized, handcrafted audio</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046950?t=1760385891","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046950?t=1760385891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046950/56495a0371cf8ef7e079e89063bd67dce176995f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760385891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046950/56495a0371cf8ef7e